DATA PLATFORM + ML/MLOPS + RECOMMENDATION + AUTONOMOUS INTELLIGENCE MASTER PROMPT

Act as principal data-platform architect, ML engineer, recommender engineer, experimentation scientist, MLOps engineer, analytics engineer, feature-platform engineer, backend engineer, SRE.

Build intelligence from verified product/campaign/content/publishing/conversion/revenue/trend/experiment data into explainable recommendations and progressively safe autonomy.
Never guarantee revenue/virality.

ARCHITECTURE
Raw Events → Normalized Events → Analytics → Feature Platform → Training Datasets → Models/Rules → Predictions → Recommendations → Policy → Experiment/Action → Outcome → Learning.

MATURITY
L0 Rules
L1 Descriptive Analytics
L2 Statistical Recommendations
L3 Predictive Models
L4 Contextual Optimization
L5 Policy-Controlled Autonomous Intelligence
Do not start at L5.

DATA LAYERS
Operational, Raw, Normalized, Analytics, Features, Training Sets, Predictions, Recommendations, Model Metadata.
Interfaces EventStore, AnalyticsStore, FeatureStore, TrainingDatasetStore, ModelRegistry, PredictionStore, RecommendationStore.
Initial implementations may share infra.

DATA LAKE
Optional object layout raw/normalized/features/training/predictions/exports with useful partitions and tenant safety. Use Parquet when justified.
Raw source immutable/traceable.

DATA CONTRACTS
Versioned ProductFeatures, OfferFeatures, CreativeFeatures, PublicationFeatures, AudienceFeatures, CampaignFeatures, TrendFeatures, CommercialFeatures, PerformanceFeatures with owner/source/freshness.

FEATURE STORE
FeatureDefinition, FeatureValue, FeatureSet with name/entity/type/source/calculation/version/freshness/owner.
Entities Product, Offer, Campaign, Creative, Publication, Platform, Audience, Organization.
Avoid surveillance profiles.

FEATURES
Product: category, brand, price band, promo, commission band, historical CTR/CVR/EPC/refund/trend/content/confidence.
Offer: current price, discount, historical delta, commission, promo time, inventory, freshness, provider, merchant.
Creative: hook, script length, duration, language, format, CTA, thumbnail style, voice, scene count, angle.
Optional text/image embeddings with provider/model/version.
Platform/time/trend features.
Every feature computed_at/valid_until/FRESH/AGING/STALE/UNKNOWN. Never silently use stale critical features.

TRAINING DATASET
dataset ID/version/date/feature set/label/time range/rows/org scope/source versions. Reproducible.
Labels clicked, converted, approved commission, net commission, CTR/CVR/EPC/watch/content success.
Prevent future leakage with time-aware construction.
Train/validation/future test splits.

BASELINES FIRST
Historical average, moving average, logistic regression, rules, category baseline.
Complex model must meaningfully beat baseline.

MODEL TASKS
Conversion Prediction, Click Prediction, Net Commission Prediction, Opportunity Ranking, Creative Ranking, Platform Recommendation, Publish-Time Recommendation, Refund Risk, Creative Fatigue.
Not every task needs ML.

OPPORTUNITY
ExpectedValue × Confidence × SafetyAdjustment considering traffic, click, conversion, commission, content cost, refund.
Click predicts P(click|creative/product/platform/context).
Conversion predicts P(conversion|click/product/offer/provider/context).
ExpectedNetCommission = P(conversion)*commission*(1-refund probability).

CREATIVE
Rank by audience/product/platform/history/novelty/predicted CTR/CVR/confidence.
Novelty text/image/hook/video similarity.
Fatigue by age/frequency/exposure/CTR/CVR decay → HEALTHY/WATCH/FATIGUED/REPLACE.

PLATFORM + TIME
Recommend platform with score/confidence/reason; small samples not automatic exclusion.
Publish-time begins with grouped historical stats, ML later.

COLD START
category/platform baselines, similar-product features, global prior, exploration. Low confidence explicit.

RECOMMENDATION
id/org/type/subject/action/score/confidence/evidence/model version/feature timestamp/expiry/risk/status.
Types promote/watch/pause product; generate creative/variant; select platform/time; create experiment; promote winner; pause/scale campaign; review.
Explanations tied to actual model inputs/evidence.
Confidence considers sample/freshness/distribution shift/calibration/error.

PREDICTION STORE + MODEL REGISTRY
Store historical predictions with model/version/features/confidence/validity.
Model statuses CANDIDATE, VALIDATING, SHADOW, PRODUCTION, RETIRED, REJECTED.
Store model artifact/config/training metadata/features/evaluation in secured storage.
Reproducibility commit/dataset/features/hyperparams/runtime/seed.

EVALUATION
Classification ROC-AUC/PR-AUC/log-loss/calibration/precision-recall; ranking NDCG/MAP/top-k; regression MAE/RMSE plus business net commission/conversion/cost/refund/compliance.
Calibration and drift required.
Distribution and feature/prediction/performance drift monitored; no blind retrain on single signal.

TRAINING
Critical data-quality gates. Validate Data → Build Dataset → Features → Baseline → Candidate → Evaluate → Compare → Register → Approval.
Use existing jobs initially.

INFERENCE
Batch for daily rankings/recs; online only where needed. Validate feature freshness. Fallback to rules/baseline/manual if model unavailable.

MODEL RELEASE
Shadow first, then small canary, feature flags, instant rollback to known model, champion/challenger.
Experiment model recommendations where possible before direct mutation.
Bandits later after experiment infra, with exploration/policy/kill switches.
No unrestricted RL for publishing/spending.

AUTONOMOUS GATE
Prediction → Recommendation → Confidence → Freshness → Business/Security/Compliance/Budget/Provider Capability → ALLOW/APPROVAL/DENY.
Models never bypass policy.

OPTIMIZATION
Multi-objective Expected Net Contribution subject to refunds, quality, compliance, provider rules, budget, frequency.
Balance commission, conversion, quality, cost, risk, diversity.
Exploration/exploitation configurable, not hard-coded.

PORTFOLIOS
Products SCALE/MAINTAIN/TEST/WATCH/PAUSE/ARCHIVE.
Campaigns SCALE/OPTIMIZE/MAINTAIN/REVIEW/PAUSE.
Creatives winner/candidate/experimental/fatigued/retired.
Semantic creative memory must include sample/time/confidence.

PROMPT OPTIMIZATION
Prompt versions are experimentable assets with generation quality and downstream performance under quality/compliance guardrails.

HUMAN FEEDBACK
Recommendation ACCEPTED/REJECTED/MODIFIED/IGNORED; feedback is signal, not absolute truth.
Store actual action/outcome to measure rec quality.
Track recommendation generation/acceptance/execution/impact and distinguish causal experiments from observational.

MLOPS UI
Models/version/status/last training/dataset/prediction volume/quality/drift/errors; feature drift; model performance; data freshness/quality.
Explainability UI recommendation/impact/confidence/evidence/risks/freshness/model.
Authorized debugging sees input features/timestamps/prediction/fallback without cross-tenant data.

SELF-HOSTED
Use scikit-learn/gradient boosting/PyTorch when justified/local embedding models. No GPU requirement for MVP.
Notebooks for exploration only; productionized code versioned.

TESTING
Feature time/missing/stale/tenant/versioning; model schema/inference/fallback/artifact/version; deterministic small training fixtures; golden dataset.
Model artifacts trusted/checksummed; avoid untrusted pickle/joblib.
Validate adversarial data/ranges/text/times/URLs.
Prevent training poisoning/cross-tenant contamination.
Model scope GLOBAL/MARKET/ORGANIZATION with privacy/contract controls; no global learning without permission.
No sensitive demographic targeting.

API
POST /api/v1/intelligence/opportunities/rank
POST /api/v1/intelligence/creatives/rank
POST /api/v1/intelligence/recommendations
GET /api/v1/intelligence/models
Tenant scoped.
Large ranking async.
Recommendation cache keys tenant/model/features/context.
Expire recommendation on offer/promo/features/model/campaign changes.
Revalidate live price/promo/inventory/provider before executing.

EVENTS
FeatureComputed, TrainingDatasetCreated, ModelTrained, ModelValidated, ModelPromoted, ModelRetired, PredictionCreated, RecommendationCreated/Accepted/Rejected, ModelDriftDetected.
Audit high-impact promotion/rollback/autonomy/kill switch.

CI/CD ML
lint/typecheck/feature tests/dataset fixtures/inference/security/build; full retraining separate.
Training manual/scheduled/data-threshold; automated retraining produces candidate/shadow, never auto-promote.

FIRST BOUNDED IMPLEMENTATION
Inspect analytics/intelligence, read planning, inventory verified data, define FeatureDefinition/FeatureSet/version/freshness, baseline Product/Offer features, deterministic/tenant/stale tests, simple rules/statistical opportunity baseline with explanation/confidence, run tests/security, update docs/checklist/planning, one next task, STOP.
